browse_page rejects loopback ("Network error: Access to private/internal IP address 127.0.0.1 is not allowed"); browse_session navigates but returns 0-byte page (url=http://127.0.0.1:8765/greenhouse_2026-05-22/, title="", bodyLen=0). Obscura routes through cloud workers with SSRF policy blocking RFC1918/loopback — structurally cannot reach the local fixture server (host curl returns 200).
